1. System Architecture OverviewThe system is designed as a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform delivering personalized nutrition, workout planning, and real-time conversational guidance. The system integrates a mobile frontend, an asynchronous backend, persistent database storage, vector indexing for domain knowledge, and high-performance inference APIs.┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                           Flutter Mobile App                            │
└────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘
                                     │ REST / WebSockets / Voice Stream
┌────────────────────────────────────▼────────────────────────────────────┐
│                           FastAPI Backend                               │
├───────────────────┬─────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┤
│   Database Layer  │   RAG Engine        │   External AI Services        │
│   (MongoDB Atlas) │   (ChromaDB +       │   • Groq API (GPT-OSS 120B)   │
│                   │    BGE Embeddings)  │   • Retell AI (Voice Agent)   │
└───────────────────┴─────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────┘
2. Complete Technology Stack & DependenciesCore Infrastructure & Backend ServicesCategoryComponent / LibraryTechnical Description & PurposeMobile ClientFlutter FrameworkCross-platform frontend (iOS/Android) responsible for user UI/UX, chat interface, food/workout logging, and real-time audio streams.Backend APIFastAPI (Python)Asynchronous web framework orchestrating application logic, user authentication, RAG retrieval pipelines, and third-party integrations.Primary DatabaseMongoDB Atlas (fitnova_db)Document-oriented NoSQL database managing persistent state, including user profiles, dietary logs, application settings, and authentication data.Vector DatabaseChromaDB (chromadb)On-disk persistent vector store that holds 768-dimensional document embeddings created from local knowledge base files.LLM Inference EngineGroq API (openai/gpt-oss-120b)Ultra-low-latency LPU (Language Processing Unit) hosting open-weights 120B parameter models to perform real-time contextual response generation.Conversational Voice AIRetell AI APIInteractive voice-agent API facilitating natural, low-latency spoken conversations for hands-free dietary logging and workout coaching.Vector EmbeddingsBAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5Open-source embedding model running locally via langchain-huggingface to produce 768-dimensional normalized dense vectors.RAG Pipeline EngineLangChain (langchain-core)Data orchestration framework utilizing RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter (chunk size: 800, overlap: 120) for semantic retrieval.Authentication & SecurityPyJWT & Passlib (HS256)Stateless JSON Web Token authentication issuing signed 60-minute access tokens for API endpoints.Document ExtractorsPyPDF, CSV, JSONInternal text extraction utilities parsing unstructured PDFs, structured CSV tables, and JSON files into indexable documents.3. Knowledge Base Resources & Data SourcesThe accuracy and cultural relevance of the RAG pipeline depend on a curated knowledge base stored locally in the data/ directory and indexed into ChromaDB.Primary Data Sources & Citations├── data/
│   ├── pdf/
│   │   ├── Food_Composition_Table_for_Pakistan.pdf
│   │   ├── FBDG_Pakistan.pdf
│   │   ├── WHO_Physical_Activity_Guidelines.pdf
